# Avio

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` in the repository root. It contains the architecture, component, type, styling, XMPP, and verification rules for this project.

Use pnpm only.

Use the shadcn CLI for UI primitives:

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component>
```

This project uses the Base UI shadcn registry (`base-nova`) and Remix Icon, not Radix or Lucide.
